    "location": "html-block:72",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "MiCOM P138"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:73",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "The MiCOM Px30 devices are a series of Rail Catenary Protection Devices. The P138 specifically provides Directional Over-current Protection for Rail applications.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "The MiCOM P138, with a proven record of providing comprehensive, efficient protection, can be applied to a wide range of applications. A user-friendly interface and several communication ports allows simple configuration. Highly flexible, the MiCOM P138 can be customized to the user’s specific requirements.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "Independent setting groups and simplified configuration",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "The MiCOM P138 enables a wide range of applications to protect supplies and catenaries in classic and autotransformer-fed (AT) systems. With easy connection to virtually all substation and catenary network management systems, it is enhanced by a complete range of backup protection and automation functions.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "Four independent setting groups, with user-friendly control interface, store protection parameters and enable simple configuration to different operating conditions or alternative feeding. Extensive polling of information is also possible.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "MiCOM P138 also features InterMiCOM teleprotection. Available in a modular design, it can be rack, flush panel or wall surface-mounted.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "Flexibility and easy integration",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "User-friendly MiCOM P138 is fitted with 1A/5A software setting, both supported in a single device, and two remote communication interfaces. It also benefits from InterMiCOM teleprotection interface. Users can customize the MiCOM P138 to their own applications, and its flexibility enables easy integration into various substation protective schemes.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
